    PARTY `the court` DOES `s 715.52(1)(b) dismiss the charge on partial compliance` AT 3

-- EXPECT STANDING   (no time limit is stated, so the permission stays open)
#TRACE `s 715.52(1)(b) the court's permission to dismiss the charge` AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED   (the permission is performed)
#TRACE `s 715.55(1) a judge's permission to convene a conference` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a judge` DOES `s 715.55(1) convene or cause to be convened a conference` AT 3

-- EXPECT STANDING   (no time limit is stated, so the permission stays open)
