-- EXPECT FULFILLED   (the permission is performed)
#TRACE `s 715.55(1) a justice's permission to convene a conference` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a justice` DOES `s 715.55(1) convene or cause to be convened a conference` AT 3

-- EXPECT STANDING   (no time limit is stated, so the permission stays open)
#TRACE `s 715.55(1) a justice's permission to convene a conference` AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED   (the permission is performed)
#TRACE `s 715.55(3) the Attorney General's permission to establish rules and practices` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Attorney General` DOES `s 715.55(3) establish rules and practices for the convening and conducting of conferences` AT 3

-- EXPECT STANDING   (no time limit is stated, so the permission stays open)
#TRACE `s 715.55(3) the Attorney General's permission to establish rules and practices` AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED   (the duty is performed)
#TRACE `s 715.57 the police officer's duty to keep a record` AT 0 WITH
