-- EXPECT STANDING   (no time limit is stated, so the duty stays open)
#TRACE `s 715.57 the police officer's duty to keep a record` AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED   (the permission is performed)
#TRACE `s 715.58(2) a peace officer's permission to disclose information to any person` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a peace officer` DOES `s 715.58(2) disclose information in a record to any person` AT 3

-- EXPECT STANDING   (no time limit is stated, so the permission stays open)
#TRACE `s 715.58(2) a peace officer's permission to disclose information to any person` AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED   (the permission is performed)
